	)
	(text "Distortion / overdrive pedal, Linework series. Audio path and controller, version 0.1.\nBased on GS1 (MXR Distortion+) with Soft/Hard clipping, a DS-1 style Tone control,\na x4 output amplifier and digital pots for Gain, Tone and Level.\nValues match the LTspice model in pedals/distortion/sim/Flashover_circuit.inc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 45.72 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "54c450b1-0457-4800-bc9b-617d22f4bdf7")
	)
	(text "Signal flow:  Input and Gain  ->  Clipping  ->  Tone and Output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 99.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "2f360492-00d5-46ab-beaa-15972d442d4f")
	)
	(text "Controller and Digital Pots connect to the audio sheets through global labels\n(HARD_SEL, SDA, SCL) and the +3V3 power symbol."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 143.51 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "fc75c73e-0f9f-4853-ad4d-6626aac67504")
	)
	(text "Still to be drawn (later sheets):\n- Controls: three endless encoders with LED rings, Soft/Hard button with two LEDs\n- MIDI in / MIDI out (Linework loop)\n- Bypass relay, footswitch and status LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 149.86 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "daf532c2-809d-4a85-a2eb-d5ed407c3990")
	)
